            </creation>
            <history xml:id="history_86efe713">
               <p xml:id="idm83">Gade arranged the choral on his way home from Leipzig in March 1853. His father-in-law was the composer and organist at Vor Frue Kirke in Copenhagen, J.P.E. Hartmann (1805-1900), who stood in as a substitute as a conductor of Musikforeningen's concerts while Gade was away.</p>
